From: accel-virt
Subject: [PATCH] Direct3D 9 texture coordinate wrapping interpolates the wrapped components around the cylinder per triangle

When a WRAPn render state is set, the fixed-function pixel shader takes the texture
coordinates of the stages that use that set per vertex through fragment shader
barycentrics, moves each vertex of the triangle by whole units so that it lies within
half a unit of the first, and interpolates those. Hosts without the extension and
states without a wrap run the shader they ran before.
---
